(6519643, 969784, 117912, '<td valign="top">Simply superb - excellent focus and exposure.  Straight out of a sci-if movie.</td>', 'Simply superb - excellent focus and exposure.  Straight out of a sci-if movie.', '2011-08-29 14:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519646, 969777, 117912, '<td valign="top">Almost surreal - the business of the brightly lit bridge, the bustling traffic - and then the two people fishing in the foreground.</td>', 'Almost surreal - the business of the brightly lit bridge, the bustling traffic - and then the two people fishing in the foreground.', '2011-08-29 14:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519656, 969371, 117912, '<td valign="top">I haven''t been to Seattle in many, many years, but the mountain peaking out of the background brought it all back to mind.  Beautiful photo.</td>', 'I haven''t been to Seattle in many, many years, but the mountain peaking out of the background brought it all back to mind.  Beautiful photo.', '2011-08-29 14:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519657, 969447, 117912, '<td valign="top">Such fantastic detail - 800 pixels just can''t do it justice.</td>', 'Such fantastic detail - 800 pixels just can''t do it justice.', '2011-08-29 14:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519659, 969595, 117912, '<td valign="top">A simple change of light brings out so much more in a building.</td>', 'A simple change of light brings out so much more in a building.', '2011-08-29 14:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519662, 969758, 3306, '<td valign="top">Woops! Nice Shot anyway.</td>', 'Woops! Nice Shot anyway.', '2011-08-29 14:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519664, 969588, 117912, '<td valign="top">Such a modern vertical city - definitely not shying away from color and light.</td>', 'Such a modern vertical city - definitely not shying away from color and light.', '2011-08-29 14:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519666, 969393, 117912, '<td valign="top">I always find it amazing how different a reflection can look from the reflected - beautiful colors</td>', 'I always find it amazing how different a reflection can look from the reflected - beautiful colors', '2011-08-29 14:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519668, 969296, 117912, '<td valign="top">One of the few wide angle nightscapes - where it loses a lot of definition, it gains a sense of scale.</td>', 'One of the few wide angle nightscapes - where it loses a lot of definition, it gains a sense of scale.', '2011-08-29 15:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519671, 969759, 117912, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and perspective - it''s amazing just how much light there is in a city at night.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and perspective - it''s amazing just how much light there is in a city at night.', '2011-08-29 15:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519674, 969181, 117912, '<td valign="top">A fantastic captured scene - a whole story in a moment of capture.</td>', 'A fantastic captured scene - a whole story in a moment of capture.', '2011-08-29 15:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519676, 969439, 117912, '<td valign="top">Night photography is so hard to balance between DOF and getting enough light for a shot - the diagonal leading line builds a nice demarcation between perfect focus, motion blurred water and the background with bokeh.</td>', 'Night photography is so hard to balance between DOF and getting enough light for a shot - the diagonal leading line builds a nice demarcation between perfect focus, motion blurred water and the background with bokeh.', '2011-08-29 15:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519677, 969579, 117912, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture of near perfect reflection.  I wonder what it would look like with less crop on the bottom and bringing the tower more to the right.</td>', 'Wonderful capture of near perfect reflection.  I wonder what it would look like with less crop on the bottom and bringing the tower more to the right.', '2011-08-29 15:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519678, 969502, 117912, '<td valign="top">Do people in New York City ever see stars?  The nightlife and color be best experienced in person - but I prefer the pace and distance of a photo.</td>', 'Do people in New York City ever see stars?  The nightlife and color be best experienced in person - but I prefer the pace and distance of a photo.', '2011-08-29 15:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519680, 969452, 117912, '<td valign="top">Superb focus and reflection - truly a still moment in time.</td>', 'Superb focus and reflection - truly a still moment in time.', '2011-08-29 15:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519683, 969245, 117912, '<td valign="top">A novel view - both profound and whimsical - the gritty realism and the choice of subject and angle.</td>', 'A novel view - both profound and whimsical - the gritty realism and the choice of subject and angle.', '2011-08-29 15:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519689, 969584, 117912, '<td valign="top">So many intersections - looks like one incredibly busy place.</td>', 'So many intersections - looks like one incredibly busy place.', '2011-08-29 15:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519738, 969485, 137358, '<td valign="top">I love the soft lighting and etherial feel to this shot. there seems to be a little problem with the horizon line though, to me it seems to be slanting down to the right. A little work in Photoshop rotate free rotate would sort this.</td>', 'I love the soft lighting and etherial feel to this shot. there seems to be a little problem with the horizon line though, to me it seems to be slanting down to the right. A little work in Photoshop rotate free rotate would sort this.', '2011-08-29 16:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519739, 969589, 137358, '<td valign="top">Looks like a high ISO 800 or so . there is a grainyness to this picture that spoils the overall effect, Nice concept, but a little lacking in intrest for me.</td>', 'Looks like a high ISO 800 or so . there is a grainyness to this picture that spoils the overall effect, Nice concept, but a little lacking in intrest for me.', '2011-08-29 16:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519741, 969588, 137358, '<td valign="top">There are so many similar entries to this challenge that you have to stand out to be noticed, and this does. Nice lines with the V shape cupping the city. well focused and not oversaturated. Good camera work.</td>', 'There are so many similar entries to this challenge that you have to stand out to be noticed, and this does. Nice lines with the V shape cupping the city. well focused and not oversaturated. Good camera work.', '2011-08-29 16:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519742, 969579, 137358, '<td valign="top">Just disimilar enough from the other entries to stand out.<br/>Nice work on focus and colour. Good control of intrest with a sky that ads to the overall effect. A minor niggle is the dark area to the left and bottom left which detracts fromt the whole, a little creative crop might increase impact.</td>', 'Just disimilar enough from the other entries to stand out.Nice work on focus and colour. Good control of intrest with a sky that ads to the overall effect. A minor niggle is the dark area to the left and bottom left which detracts fromt the whole, a little creative crop might increase impact.', '2011-08-29 16:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519745, 969417, 137358, '<td valign="top">Nice variation on the main theme, slightly let down by the fact this image is slanting to the right.noticably. It seems as though the ripples led you astray as they seem straight to the edge. Nice colour. good focus.</td>', 'Nice variation on the main theme, slightly let down by the fact this image is slanting to the right.noticably. It seems as though the ripples led you astray as they seem straight to the edge. Nice colour. good focus.', '2011-08-29 16:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519746, 969752, 137358, '<td valign="top">Lovely work, well done on catching the clarity of the tram, and motion at the same time, I love this image and the obvious technical work. A little less pastel shading and more colour would help for me, but that is purelly a peronal preferance not a technical comment. Well done.</td>', 'Lovely work, well done on catching the clarity of the tram, and motion at the same time, I love this image and the obvious technical work. A little less pastel shading and more colour would help for me, but that is purelly a peronal preferance not a technical comment. Well done.', '2011-08-29 16:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519748, 969245, 137358, '<td valign="top">I love the breaking of the rules in this picture, the lack of thirds, the angles and lines going everywhere, the confusion which gives the whole. Even the flare adds to this. Lovely interpretation.</td>', 'I love the breaking of the rules in this picture, the lack of thirds, the angles and lines going everywhere, the confusion which gives the whole. Even the flare adds to this. Lovely interpretation.', '2011-08-29 16:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519764, 969752, 117912, '<td valign="top">Excellent motion capture at night.  You get caught up in wondering who are they and where are they going or where they came from.</td>', 'Excellent motion capture at night.  You get caught up in wondering who are they and where are they going or where they came from.', '2011-08-29 16:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519766, 969391, 117912, '<td valign="top">An unusual subject for a nightscape though intriguing with all the lines, lights and shadows.  Great DOF and reflections.</td>', 'An unusual subject for a nightscape though intriguing with all the lines, lights and shadows.  Great DOF and reflections.', '2011-08-29 16:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519768, 969769, 117912, '<td valign="top">Interesting study in lighting and shadow - I have to wonder though if the balance in the light would be more suitable to moving the ship off center for more negative space</td>', 'Interesting study in lighting and shadow - I have to wonder though if the balance in the light would be more suitable to moving the ship off center for more negative space', '2011-08-29 16:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519773, 969447, 73942, '<td valign="top">fantastic nighttime cityscape</td>', 'fantastic nighttime cityscape', '2011-08-29 16:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519774, 969777, 73942, '<td valign="top">goodjob getting the pple to hold still for the longer exposure</td>', 'goodjob getting the pple to hold still for the longer exposure', '2011-08-29 16:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519775, 969743, 117912, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and an interesting subject - was it a conscious decision to shoot at the angle rather straight across - it feels heavy to the right - especially with the green diagonal circles pushing the eye in that direction.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and an interesting subject - was it a conscious decision to shoot at the angle rather straight across - it feels heavy to the right - especially with the green diagonal circles pushing the eye in that direction.', '2011-08-29 16:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519778, 969235, 117912, '<td valign="top">There is no greater mix of different tastes than in a big city - and New York is one of the busiest.  Great DOF - this must look even better in it''s full resolution</td>', 'There is no greater mix of different tastes than in a big city - and New York is one of the busiest.  Great DOF - this must look even better in it''s full resolution', '2011-08-29 17:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519780, 969330, 117912, '<td valign="top">I am so glad modern architecture started taking the environment into consideration - views and photo''s like these are truly breathtaking.  Excellent DOF.</td>', 'I am so glad modern architecture started taking the environment into consideration - views and photo''s like these are truly breathtaking.  Excellent DOF.', '2011-08-29 17:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519781, 969086, 117912, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition with detail in the front and back - perhaps it''s an artifact of processing or resizing, but the figures both in the foreground and background all seem out of focus.</td>', 'Beautiful composition with detail in the front and back - perhaps it''s an artifact of processing or resizing, but the figures both in the foreground and background all seem out of focus.', '2011-08-29 17:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519782, 968815, 117912, '<td valign="top">Fireworks are always beautiful - wherever and whenever they occur - I like how the statue seems to be shading her eyes from the glare of the lights.</td>', 'Fireworks are always beautiful - wherever and whenever they occur - I like how the statue seems to be shading her eyes from the glare of the lights.', '2011-08-29 17:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519784, 969509, 117912, '<td valign="top">Nice late evening sunset - great DOF - even the plane flying across near the top right.</td>', 'Nice late evening sunset - great DOF - even the plane flying across near the top right.', '2011-08-29 17:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519790, 969758, 82545, '<td valign="top">Are those car headlights shining on the hills? Thanks for taking this shot, it makes me want to go out and give it a try.</td>', 'Are those car headlights shining on the hills? Thanks for taking this shot, it makes me want to go out and give it a try.', '2011-08-29 17:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519792, 969781, 117912, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject choice - lots of color and a fun play of light and shadow.</td>', 'Interesting subject choice - lots of color and a fun play of light and shadow.', '2011-08-29 17:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519795, 969708, 117912, '<td valign="top">Not sure I see the reason for tonemapping on this shot - it lends a feeling of permanence - like a series of statues the colors remind me of a Norman Rockwell print.</td>', 'Not sure I see the reason for tonemapping on this shot - it lends a feeling of permanence - like a series of statues the colors remind me of a Norman Rockwell print.', '2011-08-29 17:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519796, 969614, 117912, '<td valign="top">Black and white at night always tends to create stunning images - the reflections, bokeh and DOF are superb.</td>', 'Black and white at night always tends to create stunning images - the reflections, bokeh and DOF are superb.', '2011-08-29 17:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519797, 969544, 117912, '<td valign="top">Probably the only shot in the challenge to create a truly abstract image from a nightscape.  It doesn''t work for me personally without some reference that a little bit of natural lighting may provide - it is obviously large, but how large is large?</td>', 'Probably the only shot in the challenge to create a truly abstract image from a nightscape.  It doesn''t work for me personally without some reference that a little bit of natural lighting may provide - it is obviously large, but how large is large?', '2011-08-29 17:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519803, 969589, 117912, '<td valign="top">What is the subject of the photo? A McDonalds at night? The bokeh on the lights?  It is holding a secret rather than letting the viewer understand what it is say...</td>', 'What is the subject of the photo? A McDonalds at night? The bokeh on the lights?  It is holding a secret rather than letting the viewer understand what it is say...', '2011-08-29 17:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519809, 969448, 117912, '<td valign="top">Color and life late at night - something New York city excels at.  I wonder what a selective focus or tilt-shift lens could have done with the composition.</td>', 'Color and life late at night - something New York city excels at.  I wonder what a selective focus or tilt-shift lens could have done with the composition.', '2011-08-29 17:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519814, 969217, 117912, '<td valign="top">Wonderful sense of scale and balance - the person silhouetted in the gate anchors the palace above and sets a great comparison for size.  It may just be the lighting, but the focus seems a bit in front of the palace.</td>', 'Wonderful sense of scale and balance - the person silhouetted in the gate anchors the palace above and sets a great comparison for size.  It may just be the lighting, but the focus seems a bit in front of the palace.', '2011-08-29 17:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519833, 969767, 137358, '<td valign="top">Nice<br/>lovely control of saturation and hue.<br/>I like the clarity of the reflection and the movement from the people. <br/>Slightly of centre, but then again this is not too much of a fault. if itis indeed a fault. there seems to be a slight border to the sculpture, do not know if this is a proccessing fault or just a reflection. Good luck.</td>', 'Nicelovely control of saturation and hue.I like the clarity of the reflection and the movement from the people. Slightly of centre, but then again this is not too much of a fault. if itis indeed a fault. there seems to be a slight border to the sculpture, do not know if this is a proccessing fault or just a reflection. Good luck.', '2011-08-29 18:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519837, 969769, 137358, '<td valign="top">Nice concept. I like the idea and the image.<br/>The upper deck seems a little blown, a little work with Burn and dodge might help. The sky seems to dominate, I would crop it a bit.<br/>Good control of focus and depth.</td>', 'Nice concept. I like the idea and the image.The upper deck seems a little blown, a little work with Burn and dodge might help. The sky seems to dominate, I would crop it a bit.Good control of focus and depth.', '2011-08-29 18:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519840, 969330, 137358, '<td valign="top">Well spoted, excecuted and presented. the focus and depth of field are very well controlled.<br/>Love the reflection and light in this picture. <br/>good luck</td>', 'Well spoted, excecuted and presented. the focus and depth of field are very well controlled.Love the reflection and light in this picture. good luck', '2011-08-29 18:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519842, 969777, 10523, '<td valign="top">great shot</td>', 'great shot', '2011-08-29 18:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519843, 969255, 10523, '<td valign="top">excellent shot</td>', 'excellent shot', '2011-08-29 18:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519844, 969583, 10523, '<td valign="top">best in the challenge</td>', 'best in the challenge', '2011-08-29 18:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519849, 969448, 137358, '<td valign="top">Nice control of focus and shutter here. almost journalistic in its imagrey. Might have had a bit more impact with some blur on the pedestrians but I can see that this may have presented problems from the shot sight. I like this image. good luck</td>', 'Nice control of focus and shutter here. almost journalistic in its imagrey. Might have had a bit more impact with some blur on the pedestrians but I can see that this may have presented problems from the shot sight. I like this image. good luck', '2011-08-29 18:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519850, 969757, 117912, '<td valign="top">Nice leading lines and soft colors - the blurred flags show a longer exposure.  Nice DOF but perhaps the processing or camera motion left the picture looking a bit soft.</td>', 'Nice leading lines and soft colors - the blurred flags show a longer exposure.  Nice DOF but perhaps the processing or camera motion left the picture looking a bit soft.', '2011-08-29 18:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519851, 969776, 117912, '<td valign="top">Tremendous DOF - the lighting and shadows they cast are beautiful.  the bokeh on the lights is beautiful.</td>', 'Tremendous DOF - the lighting and shadows they cast are beautiful.  the bokeh on the lights is beautiful.', '2011-08-29 18:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519852, 969603, 117912, '<td valign="top">Glass smooth water always adds to a photo with gently sweeping reflections - this one doesn''t seem to work as well as others without more lighting on the buildings to the right.  So much detail is there, but just out of reach.</td>', 'Glass smooth water always adds to a photo with gently sweeping reflections - this one doesn''t seem to work as well as others without more lighting on the buildings to the right.  So much detail is there, but just out of reach.', '2011-08-29 18:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519853, 969255, 117912, '<td valign="top">An old world nightscape replete with gorgeous architecture and lightning to boot.  Beautiful capture of a moment.</td>', 'An old world nightscape replete with gorgeous architecture and lightning to boot.  Beautiful capture of a moment.', '2011-08-29 18:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519861, 969767, 117912, '<td valign="top">this sculpture is photographed quite often, but seldom with the reflection being the subject.  A great photo that captures the imagination.</td>', 'this sculpture is photographed quite often, but seldom with the reflection being the subject.  A great photo that captures the imagination.', '2011-08-29 18:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519866, 969485, 117912, '<td valign="top">A teriffic fantasy shot - I can easily imagine the road full of cars traveling being mobs of people with torches and the lighthouse being a tower on a castle.</td>', 'A teriffic fantasy shot - I can easily imagine the road full of cars traveling being mobs of people with torches and the lighthouse being a tower on a castle.', '2011-08-29 18:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519871, 969767, 59796, '<td valign="top">Very cool variation on the skyline concept. Looks like you stopped down quite a bit - the starry effect from the lights is quite nice. <br/>Wondering if there''s any way you could''ve used a normal lens instead of ultra-wide to capture the scene from a distance - just because the leaning building in the background feels like a mild distraction, the bean is distorting perspective enough already.</td>', 'Very cool variation on the skyline concept. Looks like you stopped down quite a bit - the starry effect from the lights is quite nice. Wondering if there''s any way you could''ve used a normal lens instead of ultra-wide to capture the scene from a distance - just because the leaning building in the background feels like a mild distraction, the bean is distorting perspective enough already.', '2011-08-29 18:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519872, 968867, 117912, '<td valign="top">I see a sandstorm on beach overlooking a city whose inhabitants have take shelter for the night - safe from the tempest that wails outside the walls.</td>', 'I see a sandstorm on beach overlooking a city whose inhabitants have take shelter for the night - safe from the tempest that wails outside the walls.', '2011-08-29 18:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519874, 969583, 117912, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors and amazing DOF - the soft reflection in the water adds a timeless feel.</td>', 'Wonderful colors and amazing DOF - the soft reflection in the water adds a timeless feel.', '2011-08-29 18:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519875, 969781, 59796, '<td valign="top">Nice cool lighting on the stairs. Thankfully, this isn''t yet another skyline of Seattle in the challenge :) Just enough interest in the background to be intriguing.</td>', 'Nice cool lighting on the stairs. Thankfully, this isn''t yet another skyline of Seattle in the challenge :) Just enough interest in the background to be intriguing.', '2011-08-29 18:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519876, 969205, 117912, '<td valign="top">Quite the collection of structures overlooking the bay - would make a fine postcard.</td>', 'Quite the collection of structures overlooking the bay - would make a fine postcard.', '2011-08-29 18:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519880, 969758, 117912, '<td valign="top">Having traveled a fair amount I know better than to discount this as not being a city nightscape - some cities do a fine job of incorporating the natural environment - the DOF seems to be lacking somewhat though in that the foreground is soft and undefined.</td>', 'Having traveled a fair amount I know better than to discount this as not being a city nightscape - some cities do a fine job of incorporating the natural environment - the DOF seems to be lacking somewhat though in that the foreground is soft and undefined.', '2011-08-29 18:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519883, 969708, 25190, '<td valign="top">Its a basball game?..sorry this DNMC</td>', 'Its a basball game?..sorry this DNMC', '2011-08-29 18:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519884, 969509, 59796, '<td valign="top">Would''ve liked to see more detail in the foreground somehow. Other than the subject, it''s hard for me to make out that it''s a stadium (the floodlights ofcourse help :). Good luck.</td>', 'Would''ve liked to see more detail in the foreground somehow. Other than the subject, it''s hard for me to make out that it''s a stadium (the floodlights ofcourse help :). Good luck.', '2011-08-29 18:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519886, 969482, 117912, '<td valign="top">Is that zombies with torches shuffling by? -  Nice color and intriguing concept - perhaps betrayed by handheld shot...</td>', 'Is that zombies with torches shuffling by? -  Nice color and intriguing concept - perhaps betrayed by handheld shot...', '2011-08-29 18:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519890, 969444, 117912, '<td valign="top">Magnificent - Everything is clear and focused, the colors are bright without being too saturated - I can''t imagine what the evening sounded like from this vantage point.</td>', 'Magnificent - Everything is clear and focused, the colors are bright without being too saturated - I can''t imagine what the evening sounded like from this vantage point.', '2011-08-29 18:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519892, 969771, 59796, '<td valign="top">Nice to see something different from a night skyline. Could''ve used more interest in the subject though - maybe an S-curve in the road or some such added interest. While this is a good pic, it''s not outstanding enough I think. Good luck.</td>', 'Nice to see something different from a night skyline. Could''ve used more interest in the subject though - maybe an S-curve in the road or some such added interest. While this is a good pic, it''s not outstanding enough I think. Good luck.', '2011-08-29 18:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519893, 969582, 117912, '<td valign="top">The mountain skyline adds more to this photo than the city in the foreground as there isn''t a real subject to look at or a definitive place to look.</td>', 'The mountain skyline adds more to this photo than the city in the foreground as there isn''t a real subject to look at or a definitive place to look.', '2011-08-29 18:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519896, 969482, 59796, '<td valign="top">If it were a crop of just those top squiggles (maybe some of them of different color from orange - maybe red/green from the traffic stops), it would''ve worked as an abstract. But the combination of those squiggles with the lines in the bottom half, doesn''t quite work for me. Also, it''s a bit too bright and burnt out in the lights that''s distracting. As such, it looks like a random pic taken without a tripod or proper exposure, rather than as an abstract taken with a vision. Maybe it''s just me. Good luck.</td>', 'If it were a crop of just those top squiggles (maybe some of them of different color from orange - maybe red/green from the traffic stops), it would''ve worked as an abstract. But the combination of those squiggles with the lines in the bottom half, doesn''t quite work for me. Also, it''s a bit too bright and burnt out in the lights that''s distracting. As such, it looks like a random pic taken without a tripod or proper exposure, rather than as an abstract taken with a vision. Maybe it''s just me. Good luck.', '2011-08-29 19:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519897, 969779, 117912, '<td valign="top">A deft mixture of high and low key - perhaps too strongly contrasted for my taste, but very evocative.</td>', 'A deft mixture of high and low key - perhaps too strongly contrasted for my taste, but very evocative.', '2011-08-29 19:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519898, 969693, 59796, '<td valign="top">Very cool perspective. The blue building towards the center is dominating the picture entirely. Cool as it is, I think the picture might do even better as a high contrast Black and White with a little bit of the far left chopped off for balance.</td>', 'Very cool perspective. The blue building towards the center is dominating the picture entirely. Cool as it is, I think the picture might do even better as a high contrast Black and White with a little bit of the far left chopped off for balance.', '2011-08-29 19:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519899, 969258, 117912, '<td valign="top">The wide angle adds an interesting barrel distortion to the composition - The lighting and color is very nice.</td>', 'The wide angle adds an interesting barrel distortion to the composition - The lighting and color is very nice.', '2011-08-29 19:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519900, 969771, 117912, '<td valign="top">Cities at night bring interesting sights - even the simple passage of a vehicle lends an artistic blur and streaks of light - it''s a shame there are still so many cities relying on the golden amber sodium lights.</td>', 'Cities at night bring interesting sights - even the simple passage of a vehicle lends an artistic blur and streaks of light - it''s a shame there are still so many cities relying on the golden amber sodium lights.', '2011-08-29 19:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519902, 969235, 59796, '<td valign="top">Love the cross-roads forming an X in the pic. A busy city that doesn''t sleep - portrayed very well in this pic.<br/> <br/>I understand that Times Square is very bright with all those screens..<br/>I also understand that it must''ve been dark already because the vehicles have lights turned on.<br/>However, it''s not dark enough, and the people aren''t blurry from an extended exposure. It just doesn''t "feel" like a nightscape well after the sun goes down - I wonder if that''s hurting your score. Good luck.</td>', 'Love the cross-roads forming an X in the pic. A busy city that doesn''t sleep - portrayed very well in this pic. I understand that Times Square is very bright with all those screens..I also understand that it must''ve been dark already because the vehicles have lights turned on.However, it''s not dark enough, and the people aren''t blurry from an extended exposure. It just doesn''t "feel" like a nightscape well after the sun goes down - I wonder if that''s hurting your score. Good luck.', '2011-08-29 19:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519903, 969217, 59796, '<td valign="top">The top half would''ve made an impressive pic by itself I think. The bottom half is too blank for me, and it''s not tone-matching the rest of the pic either. Good luck.</td>', 'The top half would''ve made an impressive pic by itself I think. The bottom half is too blank for me, and it''s not tone-matching the rest of the pic either. Good luck.', '2011-08-29 19:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519905, 969696, 117912, '<td valign="top">Home is where the heart is - in city or country - beauty is not so much as where we see it, but how we feel it and share it with others.  The focus is very nice, but perhaps a little bit in front of the wall of houses - The lighting is fantastic - particularly the light splashed onto the building with the red balconies - the sharpness helps define just how close the buildings are.</td>', 'Home is where the heart is - in city or country - beauty is not so much as where we see it, but how we feel it and share it with others.  The focus is very nice, but perhaps a little bit in front of the wall of houses - The lighting is fantastic - particularly the light splashed onto the building with the red balconies - the sharpness helps define just how close the buildings are.', '2011-08-29 19:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519907, 969482, 25190, '<td valign="top">This long exposure does fit with the challenge i think have enter in the wrong challenge maybe sure no city here</td>', 'This long exposure does fit with the challenge i think have enter in the wrong challenge maybe sure no city here', '2011-08-29 19:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519908, 969614, 59796, '<td valign="top">Good conversion to Black &amp; White, and nice starry lights and smooth water. Bonus for including a semi-interesting foreground, but the abrupt edge on the bottom left is distracting. A minor crop or a minor change in composition would easily solve it though.</td>', 'Good conversion to Black & White, and nice starry lights and smooth water. Bonus for including a semi-interesting foreground, but the abrupt edge on the bottom left is distracting. A minor crop or a minor change in composition would easily solve it though.', '2011-08-29 19:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519909, 969529, 117912, '<td valign="top">The photo seems a little heavy toward the right side where there is a hole of negative space in an otherwise well defined image - it pulls the eye in but it doesn''t show anything.  Cropped a little further up showing more of the creamy violet sky may balance this a little more at the cost of some of the light reflections on the left.</td>', 'The photo seems a little heavy toward the right side where there is a hole of negative space in an otherwise well defined image - it pulls the eye in but it doesn''t show anything.  Cropped a little further up showing more of the creamy violet sky may balance this a little more at the cost of some of the light reflections on the left.', '2011-08-29 19:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519910, 968815, 25190, '<td valign="top">Too much negative space here no city in sight read  challenge info</td>', 'Too much negative space here no city in sight read  challenge info', '2011-08-29 19:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519911, 969665, 117912, '<td valign="top">Beijing is an interesting city in that it embraces the past and lights the way of the future of China.  Even the casual picture can show a certain charm.</td>', 'Beijing is an interesting city in that it embraces the past and lights the way of the future of China.  Even the casual picture can show a certain charm.', '2011-08-29 19:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519912, 969245, 59796, '<td valign="top">Nice! The non-vertical composition, the beautiful lens flare top-left, the splotches of color from the traffic lights, the random lines on the road/sidewalk/underbridge - a weird combination that works well for me. A sort of fully intended randomness to the pic.</td>', 'Nice! The non-vertical composition, the beautiful lens flare top-left, the splotches of color from the traffic lights, the random lines on the road/sidewalk/underbridge - a weird combination that works well for me. A sort of fully intended randomness to the pic.', '2011-08-29 19:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519914, 969693, 117912, '<td valign="top">Wide angle lenses make for interesting photographic results - they also are great for incredible DOF and light capture.  Beautiful capture though I feel the crop might have held the distortion more centered.</td>', 'Wide angle lenses make for interesting photographic results - they also are great for incredible DOF and light capture.  Beautiful capture though I feel the crop might have held the distortion more centered.', '2011-08-29 19:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519916, 969417, 117912, '<td valign="top">Luscious blues and green, I only wish more of it were in focus or perhaps with a little less contrast.</td>', 'Luscious blues and green, I only wish more of it were in focus or perhaps with a little less contrast.', '2011-08-29 19:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519918, 969748, 117912, '<td valign="top">There is so much detail missed in the darkness.  The blue bridge is fascinating and I would love to see move of it up close.</td>', 'There is so much detail missed in the darkness.  The blue bridge is fascinating and I would love to see move of it up close.', '2011-08-29 19:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519922, 969748, 59796, '<td valign="top">The blue bridge is very cool. <br/>The combination of that with a warmly and dimly lit downtown isn''t quite working for me though. Maybe a Black &amp; White conversion?<br/>Also, the water level is a bit too close to the center for me. And the overall detail in the picture isn''t up to par - feels like a massive crop of the original capture. Maybe it''s just me. Good luck.</td>', 'The blue bridge is very cool. The combination of that with a warmly and dimly lit downtown isn''t quite working for me though. Maybe a Black & White conversion?Also, the water level is a bit too close to the center for me. And the overall detail in the picture isn''t up to par - feels like a massive crop of the original capture. Maybe it''s just me. Good luck.', '2011-08-29 19:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519926, 969589, 59796, '<td valign="top">Please pm me if you want this comment removed - I''m trying to give my honest feedback.<br/>Feels like a first attempt at capturing night scenes, and as such, has a couple of good things going for it. The starry effect on the lights for one, and no shake for another. Aside from those, I don''t see any captivating subject or narrative in the picture. Just another road picture as far as I can tell. I don''t even know what to make of the title. The cool flash light in the foreground is at odds with the warm lighting in the rest of the pic as well. <br/>Keep shooting and you will come to enjoy night shooting as you improve gradually.</td>', 'Please pm me if you want this comment removed - I''m trying to give my honest feedback.Feels like a first attempt at capturing night scenes, and as such, has a couple of good things going for it. The starry effect on the lights for one, and no shake for another. Aside from those, I don''t see any captivating subject or narrative in the picture. Just another road picture as far as I can tell. I don''t even know what to make of the title. The cool flash light in the foreground is at odds with the warm lighting in the rest of the pic as well. Keep shooting and you will come to enjoy night shooting as you improve gradually.', '2011-08-29 19:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519931, 969748, 10785, '<td valign="top">Love the blue bridge but the rest of the scene appears to be lacking in luminosity and color.</td>', 'Love the blue bridge but the rest of the scene appears to be lacking in luminosity and color.', '2011-08-29 19:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519940, 969296, 59796, '<td valign="top">Nice title and capture. The colors also work well in the smooth reflections. Seems like you Seattle folks will dominate this challenge :)<br/>The water line is a little close to the center - I would''ve chopped a little bit off the top of the pic.</td>', 'Nice title and capture. The colors also work well in the smooth reflections. Seems like you Seattle folks will dominate this challenge :)The water line is a little close to the center - I would''ve chopped a little bit off the top of the pic.', '2011-08-29 19:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519944, 969448, 59796, '<td valign="top">How in the world did you manage this wide angle pic, standing in the middle of a busy road? :) Nice reminders of NYC - the subway numbers, the cabs, the jay walkers, and just the sheer number of people out and about on the streets. Good capture.</td>', 'How in the world did you manage this wide angle pic, standing in the middle of a busy road? :) Nice reminders of NYC - the subway numbers, the cabs, the jay walkers, and just the sheer number of people out and about on the streets. Good capture.', '2011-08-29 19:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519949, 969665, 59796, '<td valign="top">The tower is so interesting and wonderfully lit - a picture of it alone, shot on a tripod at low ISO would''ve done wonderfully well. This scene itself is too busy and has a few obvious problems:<br/> <br/>Looks like a handheld - it''s not sharp enough.<br/>Looks like a high ISO shot - quite some noise in the dark.<br/>And the horizon is tilted - the colorful tower and the street light are not straight and are tipping over. <br/> <br/>Just my honest feedback - please let me know if you want me to remove this comment. Thanks.</td>', 'The tower is so interesting and wonderfully lit - a picture of it alone, shot on a tripod at low ISO would''ve done wonderfully well. This scene itself is too busy and has a few obvious problems: Looks like a handheld - it''s not sharp enough.Looks like a high ISO shot - quite some noise in the dark.And the horizon is tilted - the colorful tower and the street light are not straight and are tipping over.  Just my honest feedback - please let me know if you want me to remove this comment. Thanks.', '2011-08-29 19:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519961, 969391, 59796, '<td valign="top">Nice B/W conversion. Took me a couple of seconds to orient myself in the pic - lots of lines going all over the place - and that''s both the strength and weakness of this pic for me. The top 2/3rds of the pic works very well, even with the horizontal fence in the background. The foreground horizontal fence though, is too distracting I think - maybe dim it down in post-processing will work? <br/>The converging lines from underside of the bridge and it''s shadows are simply awesome though!</td>', 'Nice B/W conversion. Took me a couple of seconds to orient myself in the pic - lots of lines going all over the place - and that''s both the strength and weakness of this pic for me. The top 2/3rds of the pic works very well, even with the horizontal fence in the background. The foreground horizontal fence though, is too distracting I think - maybe dim it down in post-processing will work? The converging lines from underside of the bridge and it''s shadows are simply awesome though!', '2011-08-29 20:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519964, 969529, 59796, '<td valign="top">Nice skyline. (not from Seattle for a change :)<br/>The trees in the bottom right are forming a dark blob that''s distracting from the picture a little bit (I understand you can''t chop trees for a pic :)</td>', 'Nice skyline. (not from Seattle for a change :)The trees in the bottom right are forming a dark blob that''s distracting from the picture a little bit (I understand you can''t chop trees for a pic :)', '2011-08-29 20:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519966, 969758, 59796, '<td valign="top">Uhoh - did you enter it in the wrong challenge by mistake :P<br/>Doesn''t say city very well with such clear sky. Interesting lighting on the foreground though - care headlights?</td>', 'Uhoh - did you enter it in the wrong challenge by mistake :PDoesn''t say city very well with such clear sky. Interesting lighting on the foreground though - care headlights?', '2011-08-29 20:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519984, 969444, 124700, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.  Really does look like Jewels in the night.</td>', 'Lovely shot.  Really does look like Jewels in the night.', '2011-08-29 20:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519986, 969255, 59796, '<td valign="top">Wow! I''ve never captured lightning myself, let alone with such nice foreground and such beautiful colors in the sky. Very impressive. Hope the camera didn''t get wet :)</td>', 'Wow! I''ve never captured lightning myself, let alone with such nice foreground and such beautiful colors in the sky. Very impressive. Hope the camera didn''t get wet :)', '2011-08-29 20:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519987, 969258, 97225, '<td valign="top">Lol at your informative title! I think this shot is stunning. And you shot it with a broken camera!  Maybe I should go break mine.</td>', 'Lol at your informative title! I think this shot is stunning. And you shot it with a broken camera!  Maybe I should go break mine.', '2011-08-29 20:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519988, 969205, 97225, '<td valign="top">How gorgeous!</td>', 'How gorgeous!', '2011-08-29 20:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519989, 969784, 59796, '<td valign="top">An impressive view of Hong Kong! The 3 lights near the bottom-middle are very very distracting from such awesome view. Since their surroundings are dark anyway, you might be able to dim them in post-processing?</td>', 'An impressive view of Hong Kong! The 3 lights near the bottom-middle are very very distracting from such awesome view. Since their surroundings are dark anyway, you might be able to dim them in post-processing?', '2011-08-29 20:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519991, 969482, 97225, '<td valign="top">I love the energy, the flow of this river of light, complete with its cascades and spray.</td>', 'I love the energy, the flow of this river of light, complete with its cascades and spray.', '2011-08-29 20:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519992, 969502, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2011-08-29 20:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519993, 969603, 59796, '<td valign="top">Very interesting! The Bridge not only crosses the water body, but also connects the warm left to the cool right :) The nice tone divide and the still reflections work very well. I would''ve cropped a little bit off the top and bottom - it''s too much negative space I think.</td>', 'Very interesting! The Bridge not only crosses the water body, but also connects the warm left to the cool right :) The nice tone divide and the still reflections work very well. I would''ve cropped a little bit off the top and bottom - it''s too much negative space I think.', '2011-08-29 20:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519995, 969296, 97225, '<td valign="top">I love the combination of beautiful glittering buildings and smooth silky reflections.</td>', 'I love the combination of beautiful glittering buildings and smooth silky reflections.', '2011-08-29 20:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519998, 969759, 59796, '<td valign="top">Neat skyline of Philadelphia. The dark blob of trees at the bottom are mildly distracting, but the buildings are strong enough subject to overcome it. The smooth water and the small portion of the reflections add to the picture nicely.</td>', 'Neat skyline of Philadelphia. The dark blob of trees at the bottom are mildly distracting, but the buildings are strong enough subject to overcome it. The smooth water and the small portion of the reflections add to the picture nicely.', '2011-08-29 20:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6519999, 969588, 97225, '<td valign="top">Great shot - love the viewpoint.</td>', 'Great shot - love the viewpoint.', '2011-08-29 20:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6520001, 969371, 97225, '<td valign="top">Fabulous colours and beautifully composed.</td>', 'Fabulous colours and beautifully composed.', '2011-08-29 20:49:11.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6520003, 969439, 97225, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful view but I think the cluttered foreground spoils it a bit.</td>', 'It''s a beautiful view but I think the cluttered foreground spoils it a bit.', '2011-08-29 20:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6520004, 969784, 97225, '<td valign="top">Wonderful view!</td>', 'Wonderful view!', '2011-08-29 20:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6520005, 969444, 97225, '<td valign="top">Lovely. I like the way the distant lights merge into haze - as though the city has no limits.</td>', 'Lovely. I like the way the distant lights merge into haze - as though the city has no limits.', '2011-08-29 20:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6520012, 969245, 97225, '<td valign="top">I like this change in the lineup. The processing and unusual viewpoint combine well.</td>', 'I like this change in the lineup. The processing and unusual viewpoint combine well.', '2011-08-29 20:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6520014, 969583, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I love those smooth reflections.</td>', 'Beautiful. I love those smooth reflections.', '2011-08-29 20:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6520015, 969579, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.', '2011-08-29 21:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6520018, 969767, 97225, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! Not just the reflection in The Bean, but the glimpses beyond it, too. The colours are gorgeous.</td>', 'Wonderful! Not just the reflection in The Bean, but the glimpses beyond it, too. The colours are gorgeous.', '2011-08-29 21:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6520025, 969583, 59796, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! The blue is a bit overpowering compared to all the muted colors, but the scene is fantastic and well balanced.</td>', 'Beautiful! The blue is a bit overpowering compared to all the muted colors, but the scene is fantastic and well balanced.', '2011-08-29 21:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6520026, 969584, 59796, '<td valign="top">The Petco Park is nice, as is the bridge and the car light trails. I''m guessing you stopped down quite a bit to get that neat starry light effect and the whole thing in focus?  <br/>The drop down in the bottom-center is quite distracting though - doesn''t really add to the pic and almost seems like an eyesore compared to the rest of the nice downtown. Would''ve been nice to have another perspective of the same scene that avoids such prominence to it.</td>', 'The Petco Park is nice, as is the bridge and the car light trails. I''m guessing you stopped down quite a bit to get that neat starry light effect and the whole thing in focus?  The drop down in the bottom-center is quite distracting though - doesn''t really add to the pic and almost seems like an eyesore compared to the rest of the nice downtown. Would''ve been nice to have another perspective of the same scene that avoids such prominence to it.', '2011-08-29 21:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6520028, 969258, 59796, '<td valign="top">Lol! Very creative title for the picture :D<br/>For a broken camera, the picture is super crisp. I now see your concern about people thinking it''s a halo. Beautiful colors on this and lots of detail. The water is more interesting though - the left side is showing signs of long exposure smoothening and the right side isn''t. I''m guessing this shot is done at less than 5 seconds of exposure?<br/>The white/black border is a bit too bold, and the picture might''ve presented itself fine without it.</td>', 'Lol! Very creative title for the picture :DFor a broken camera, the picture is super crisp. I now see your concern about people thinking it''s a halo. Beautiful colors on this and lots of detail. The water is more interesting though - the left side is showing signs of long exposure smoothening and the right side isn''t. I''m guessing this shot is done at less than 5 seconds of exposure?The white/black border is a bit too bold, and the picture might''ve presented itself fine without it.', '2011-08-29 21:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6520030, 969330, 59796, '<td valign="top">That''s an interesting building alright! Interesting patterns within the building - wish I could see this full size! And a nice reflection to boot! Interesting that I see a lot more blue windows in the reflection compared to the original. Very nice!</td>', 'That''s an interesting building alright! Interesting patterns within the building - wish I could see this full size! And a nice reflection to boot! Interesting that I see a lot more blue windows in the reflection compared to the original. Very nice!', '2011-08-29 21:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6520031, 969447, 59796, '<td valign="top">Wonderful title to a crisp picture. Very nicely captured. Love all the blue/purple/green hues on the buildings in complete contrast to the roads. Nicely balanced as well. Very well done.</td>', 'Wonderful title to a crisp picture. Very nicely captured. Love all the blue/purple/green hues on the buildings in complete contrast to the roads. Nicely balanced as well. Very well done.', '2011-08-29 21:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6520191, 969758, 132251, '<td valign="top">city nightscape?</td>', 'city nightscape?', '2011-08-29 22:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6520193, 969708, 132251, '<td valign="top">I would like to know how you processed this.</td>', 'I would like to know how you processed this.', '2011-08-29 22:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6520220, 969258, 132251, '<td valign="top">ok</td>', 'ok', '2011-08-29 22:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6520262, 969258, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice nightscape; a balanced composition.  Needs a better title though... haha ;)</td>', 'Nice nightscape; a balanced composition.  Needs a better title though... haha ;)', '2011-08-29 23:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6520264, 969588, 103032, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s nice.  I really like exploring this photo.</td>', 'Wow, that''s nice.  I really like exploring this photo.', '2011-08-29 23:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6520382, 969693, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice fisheye.  Must be way past sunset, so quiet, but so urban.</td>', 'Nice fisheye.  Must be way past sunset, so quiet, but so urban.', '2011-08-30 00:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6520481, 969614, 103032, '<td valign="top">Really nice night scene.  Very crisp.  Like the B&amp;W treatment, nice tones.  My only critique is that I think I would have moved over just a few feet of the right bollard to balance out the two bollards in the frame.  Otherwise, nice night scene.</td>', 'Really nice night scene.  Very crisp.  Like the B&W treatment, nice tones.  My only critique is that I think I would have moved over just a few feet of the right bollard to balance out the two bollards in the frame.  Otherwise, nice night scene.', '2011-08-30 00:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6520493, 969330, 136989, '<td valign="top"><u></u></td>', '', '2011-08-30 00:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6520501, 969439, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice clear photo.  I like the oars in the foreground to give some interest.</td>', 'Nice clear photo.  I like the oars in the foreground to give some interest.', '2011-08-30 00:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6520506, 969583, 103032, '<td valign="top">A classic image.  Well done; even exposure throughout the scene, crisp, nice reflections.</td>', 'A classic image.  Well done; even exposure throughout the scene, crisp, nice reflections.', '2011-08-30 00:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6520507, 969482, 136989, '<td valign="top">A bit too much for me... I wanted to be able to focus on something.</td>', 'A bit too much for me... I wanted to be able to focus on something.', '2011-08-30 00:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6520509, 969777, 136989, '<td valign="top">Incredible pic but not well after dark ...</td>', 'Incredible pic but not well after dark ...', '2011-08-30 00:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6520510, 969757, 136989, '<td valign="top">Daylight ... :(</td>', 'Daylight ... :(', '2011-08-30 00:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6520524, 969582, 136989, '<td valign="top">Sorry still feeling sunlight on this one.</td>', 'Sorry still feeling sunlight on this one.', '2011-08-30 00:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6520528, 969391, 103032, '<td valign="top">Very crisp.  All the leading lines to the center kind of gives me vertigo.  I like the B&amp;W treatment; it keeps the viewer focused on the lines.</td>', 'Very crisp.  All the leading lines to the center kind of gives me vertigo.  I like the B&W treatment; it keeps the viewer focused on the lines.', '2011-08-30 00:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6520631, 969767, 103032, '<td valign="top">Cool pic of the skyline in the reflection. Pretty crisp. Nicely exposed.</td>', 'Cool pic of the skyline in the reflection. Pretty crisp. Nicely exposed.', '2011-08-30 02:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6520659, 969485, 67237, '<td valign="top">what a beautiful place!! :-)....8</td>', 'what a beautiful place!! :-)....8', '2011-08-30 03:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6520689, 969296, 102534, '<td valign="top">This must look amazing in high res</td>', 'This must look amazing in high res', '2011-08-30 06:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6520690, 969255, 102534, '<td valign="top">Surreal shot, awesome</td>', 'Surreal shot, awesome', '2011-08-30 06:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6520691, 969439, 102534, '<td valign="top">awesome bight scene. A crop just above the oars would make this perfect imho</td>', 'awesome bight scene. A crop just above the oars would make this perfect imho', '2011-08-30 06:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6520755, 969447, 25190, '<td valign="top">Great exposure good composition  top shot ..congrats</td>', 'Great exposure good composition  top shot ..congrats', '2011-08-30 08:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6520756, 969579, 25190, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot the stillness of the water and the reflection it gives nice work the clouds give a good effect as well  great shot I bump this up i think it deserves the whole lot</td>', 'Wonderful shot the stillness of the water and the reflection it gives nice work the clouds give a good effect as well  great shot I bump this up i think it deserves the whole lot', '2011-08-30 08:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6520783, 969330, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cool building with some great reflective qualities.</td>', 'Cool building with some great reflective qualities.', '2011-08-30 09:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
