(6521005, 969603, 12611, '<td valign="top">I am mulling over the need to eschew ROT convention; I like the color but there is a lot of black at the bottom.</td>', 'I am mulling over the need to eschew ROT convention; I like the color but there is a lot of black at the bottom.', '2011-08-30 15:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521015, 969391, 12611, '<td valign="top">This is a ten for me; fantastic watery texture above; great composition.</td>', 'This is a ten for me; fantastic watery texture above; great composition.', '2011-08-30 15:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521083, 969758, 137358, '<td valign="top">Nice work, but why City nightscape and not Rural? is it a mispost? I would love to know how you toook this shot all my night shots get the line of time on the stars. or grain of hich iso. I love the texture and detail. good luck.</td>', 'Nice work, but why City nightscape and not Rural? is it a mispost? I would love to know how you toook this shot all my night shots get the line of time on the stars. or grain of hich iso. I love the texture and detail. good luck.', '2011-08-30 16:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521138, 969509, 14867, '<td valign="top">Good exposure. Despite this, the subject is barely lit and not very visible,  making the  image globally a bit confused</td>', 'Good exposure. Despite this, the subject is barely lit and not very visible,  making the  image globally a bit confused', '2011-08-30 17:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521148, 969439, 113419, '<td valign="top">not digging the foreground</td>', 'not digging the foreground', '2011-08-30 17:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521162, 969758, 91783, '<td valign="top">i think you entered the wrong challenge... :(</td>', 'i think you entered the wrong challenge... :(', '2011-08-30 18:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521188, 969393, 59796, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors. <br/>Very surprising that the colors in the reflections don''t match at all with the colors on the buildings!!<br/> <br/>Also, the picture by itself is fantastic, but the border completely ruins it. Originally, the water line was at 1/3 height in the picture - which is awesome. However, with the addition of this border, the waterline is closer to center than the 1/3 line, and thus the pic loses it''s balance.</td>', 'Lovely colors. Very surprising that the colors in the reflections don''t match at all with the colors on the buildings!! Also, the picture by itself is fantastic, but the border completely ruins it. Originally, the water line was at 1/3 height in the picture - which is awesome. However, with the addition of this border, the waterline is closer to center than the 1/3 line, and thus the pic loses it''s balance.', '2011-08-30 18:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521193, 969757, 59796, '<td valign="top">Aha! "Well after the Sun goes down" can also mean "Just before the Sun comes up"! Creative thinking :) Hope folks won''t vote you down for it and still consider this as a nightscape. <br/> <br/>The pic itself is nice and love the walkway curve in the foreground leading up to the building. I wish there was a little more separation between the foreground building and the background skyline. Right now it''s a bit unsatisfying to see the lightless roof of the building mask out a nicely lit downtown.</td>', 'Aha! "Well after the Sun goes down" can also mean "Just before the Sun comes up"! Creative thinking :) Hope folks won''t vote you down for it and still consider this as a nightscape.  The pic itself is nice and love the walkway curve in the foreground leading up to the building. I wish there was a little more separation between the foreground building and the background skyline. Right now it''s a bit unsatisfying to see the lightless roof of the building mask out a nicely lit downtown.', '2011-08-30 18:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521200, 969086, 59796, '<td valign="top">Nice to have a foreground unlike most skyline shots in the challenge. However, in this case, the foreground is completely dominating the skyline with such brilliant green color, and is becoming the subject itself. Between the two, I rather like the nice downtown here to be the main subject. Maybe tone down the saturation a good bit for the foreground? Making the green muted might help the picture more.</td>', 'Nice to have a foreground unlike most skyline shots in the challenge. However, in this case, the foreground is completely dominating the skyline with such brilliant green color, and is becoming the subject itself. Between the two, I rather like the nice downtown here to be the main subject. Maybe tone down the saturation a good bit for the foreground? Making the green muted might help the picture more.', '2011-08-30 18:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521201, 969205, 59796, '<td valign="top">What? No Space needle? :)<br/>A nice shot by itself, but having a distinguished landmark helps I think. Also, if the foreground had a little more light, it would''ve been awesome to see all those sailboats I think - a unique foreground in the challenge.</td>', 'What? No Space needle? :)A nice shot by itself, but having a distinguished landmark helps I think. Also, if the foreground had a little more light, it would''ve been awesome to see all those sailboats I think - a unique foreground in the challenge.', '2011-08-30 18:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521202, 969776, 59796, '<td valign="top">Nice! An unusual perspective I don''t normally see.<br/>I wish the Opera House was brought out a bit more in post processing somehow. Right now, the bridge is dominating the downtown and the Opera House is kind of lost - making the bridge the only subject, and as the only subject, the bridge is badly placed in the picture with no breathing room.</td>', 'Nice! An unusual perspective I don''t normally see.I wish the Opera House was brought out a bit more in post processing somehow. Right now, the bridge is dominating the downtown and the Opera House is kind of lost - making the bridge the only subject, and as the only subject, the bridge is badly placed in the picture with no breathing room.', '2011-08-30 19:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521205, 969417, 59796, '<td valign="top">Wow! Is this shot with the wrong white balance? Or is the city really this cool and futuristic? :) Very "Metropolis"!<br/> <br/>One immediately noticeable thing is that the horizon is tilted - all the buildings appear leaning to the right. Also, the overexposed part near the center-left is dominating the picture and is distracting.</td>', 'Wow! Is this shot with the wrong white balance? Or is the city really this cool and futuristic? :) Very "Metropolis"! One immediately noticeable thing is that the horizon is tilted - all the buildings appear leaning to the right. Also, the overexposed part near the center-left is dominating the picture and is distracting.', '2011-08-30 19:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521211, 969752, 59796, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot and treatment! The motion blur delivers that chaotic/busy life that characterizes a city. And the people in focus look lost in that chaos :) Even the high ISO noise is very appropriate as noise in the city life that''s depicted. My top3 in this challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful shot and treatment! The motion blur delivers that chaotic/busy life that characterizes a city. And the people in focus look lost in that chaos :) Even the high ISO noise is very appropriate as noise in the city life that''s depicted. My top3 in this challenge.', '2011-08-30 19:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521212, 969777, 59796, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! Seeking peace and calm in the midst of a bright and busy life... Love it!</td>', 'Wonderful! Seeking peace and calm in the midst of a bright and busy life... Love it!', '2011-08-30 19:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521213, 969444, 59796, '<td valign="top">I see all the basics of a good picture here though it might need a slightly different composition to stand out as one.<br/>A tighter crop might help make the subject appear more as a jewel of the city. Right now, it''s kind of lost, almost a distraction from the skyline. Also, the division of the picture into 2 equal halves - an empty top half and a busy bottom half doesn''t make it feel balanced.</td>', 'I see all the basics of a good picture here though it might need a slightly different composition to stand out as one.A tighter crop might help make the subject appear more as a jewel of the city. Right now, it''s kind of lost, almost a distraction from the skyline. Also, the division of the picture into 2 equal halves - an empty top half and a busy bottom half doesn''t make it feel balanced.', '2011-08-30 19:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521215, 969371, 59796, '<td valign="top">The classic postcard...<br/>Would''ve liked some more room on the right to give some breathing space to Mt.Rainier.<br/>Simply love the colors..<br/>Sticklers for "Well after the Sun goes down" might object to the orange sky reflections in the tops of the buildings - Good luck.</td>', 'The classic postcard...Would''ve liked some more room on the right to give some breathing space to Mt.Rainier.Simply love the colors..Sticklers for "Well after the Sun goes down" might object to the orange sky reflections in the tops of the buildings - Good luck.', '2011-08-30 19:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521218, 969743, 59796, '<td valign="top">The wonderful colors on the buildings make me want to see it in full resolution. I wouldn''t have minded a crop of this with more height, just so I can see more details. Right now, it just leaves me thirsty for more without completely wowing me. Still, darned good.</td>', 'The wonderful colors on the buildings make me want to see it in full resolution. I wouldn''t have minded a crop of this with more height, just so I can see more details. Right now, it just leaves me thirsty for more without completely wowing me. Still, darned good.', '2011-08-30 19:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521221, 969452, 59796, '<td valign="top">Interesting that the bridge reflection shows an S-curve while the bridge doesn''t. Very nice night scene of a quite canal street. The border does it a disservice though - and throws the composition slightly off-kilter.</td>', 'Interesting that the bridge reflection shows an S-curve while the bridge doesn''t. Very nice night scene of a quite canal street. The border does it a disservice though - and throws the composition slightly off-kilter.', '2011-08-30 19:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521223, 969181, 59796, '<td valign="top">Someone was frustrated! :)<br/>The conversion to Black and White is a good idea - it makes us notice the 3 main elements in the picture without getting distracted by the yellow color cast. Makes me look for a story behind the scene.<br/>However, it doesn''t quite say City to me - not talking about technicalities, but just the feel of it. Good luck.</td>', 'Someone was frustrated! :)The conversion to Black and White is a good idea - it makes us notice the 3 main elements in the picture without getting distracted by the yellow color cast. Makes me look for a story behind the scene.However, it doesn''t quite say City to me - not talking about technicalities, but just the feel of it. Good luck.', '2011-08-30 20:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521225, 969579, 59796, '<td valign="top">What an interesting tower in the left. My eye is immediately drawn to it and am slightly disappointed that its reflection got cutoff at the bottom. Would certainly look better with it I think. The colors are nice and the sky has a bit of added interest to boot. The red on the right is slightly distracting from the rest of the nice skyline.</td>', 'What an interesting tower in the left. My eye is immediately drawn to it and am slightly disappointed that its reflection got cutoff at the bottom. Would certainly look better with it I think. The colors are nice and the sky has a bit of added interest to boot. The red on the right is slightly distracting from the rest of the nice skyline.', '2011-08-30 20:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521227, 969582, 59796, '<td valign="top">The nice and subtle color gradient is lovely and adds interest to the night scene, but I don''t see any strong subject or narrative. Also, the half and half division of the pic is not very pleasing. Would''ve loved the horizon at a third of the pic so that either the city or the sky would''ve dominated and become a subject to the picture.</td>', 'The nice and subtle color gradient is lovely and adds interest to the night scene, but I don''t see any strong subject or narrative. Also, the half and half division of the pic is not very pleasing. Would''ve loved the horizon at a third of the pic so that either the city or the sky would''ve dominated and become a subject to the picture.', '2011-08-30 20:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6521263, 969439, 32011, '<td valign="top">Great photo of my favourite city in the world... would have done better with a different crop i.e. all the oars or none of them (IMHO).</td>', 'Great photo of my favourite city in the world... would have done better with a different crop i.e. all the oars or none of them (IMHO).', '2011-08-30 21:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
