(6522499, 969439, 59796, '<td valign="top">That water almost looks like ice! Very nice colors and composition. Love the bridge separating the picture into two very different worlds. A nice foreground to contrast the skyline with.</td>', 'That water almost looks like ice! Very nice colors and composition. Love the bridge separating the picture into two very different worlds. A nice foreground to contrast the skyline with.', '2011-08-31 19:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6522506, 969779, 59796, '<td valign="top">An apt title - the picture certainly portrays the Metropolis - cold, dark, ominous. Master stroke that the pictures color temperature is cool rather than warm. Nicely done. Would probably stand out even more if the buildings were cropped close, rather than the typical skyline composition now?</td>', 'An apt title - the picture certainly portrays the Metropolis - cold, dark, ominous. Master stroke that the pictures color temperature is cool rather than warm. Nicely done. Would probably stand out even more if the buildings were cropped close, rather than the typical skyline composition now?', '2011-08-31 19:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6522533, 969708, 29293, '<td valign="top">hdr from one shot?  nice!</td>', 'hdr from one shot?  nice!', '2011-08-31 20:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6522539, 969588, 59796, '<td valign="top">Wow! Is this an aerial shot? Simply amazing. Very futuristic too.. :)</td>', 'Wow! Is this an aerial shot? Simply amazing. Very futuristic too.. :)', '2011-08-31 20:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6522540, 969485, 59796, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic location and image. I understand you''d lose the detail on the hill if you underexpose a bit, but right now the lights are too bright. Inspite of it, they define the image well and help separate it out into the fast bottom and still top. Very nice.<br/>The border is useless though. Infact, it''s distracting a little at the bottom.</td>', 'What a fantastic location and image. I understand you''d lose the detail on the hill if you underexpose a bit, but right now the lights are too bright. Inspite of it, they define the image well and help separate it out into the fast bottom and still top. Very nice.The border is useless though. Infact, it''s distracting a little at the bottom.', '2011-08-31 21:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6522605, 969777, 103032, '<td valign="top">The bridge is nicely lit.  Great reflections in the water. I like the people fishing to give it scale and a story... [On a side note, I want to say this is the Interstate Bridge (Portland, OR/Vancouver, WA) on the WA side... with the Crab shack, McMenamin''s, or Beech''s on the right...]  Nice nightscape in any case.</td>', 'The bridge is nicely lit.  Great reflections in the water. I like the people fishing to give it scale and a story... [On a side note, I want to say this is the Interstate Bridge (Portland, OR/Vancouver, WA) on the WA side... with the Crab shack, McMenamin''s, or Beech''s on the right...]  Nice nightscape in any case.', '2011-08-31 21:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6522674, 969588, 109227, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done.  The perspective and dof makes the image, imo.  My favorite of the challenge</td>', 'Beautifully done.  The perspective and dof makes the image, imo.  My favorite of the challenge', '2011-08-31 23:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
