(6528736, 969447, 102534, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ownedcasey:</b></div><hr/><i> Of course there''s 1,2,3 scores. That''s what happens when people are allowed to vote in contests they''re entered in. Obviously this is a great shot. The 1,2,3 scores are from a-holes trying to make the average better. It happens to all of us unfortunately. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Yep, sad but true. Would be nice if to have a vote of 1, 2 count, a voter would need to explain why s/he thinks it is so bad</td>', 'Originally posted by ownedcasey: Of course there''s 1,2,3 scores. That''s what happens when people are allowed to vote in contests they''re entered in. Obviously this is a great shot. The 1,2,3 scores are from a-holes trying to make the average better. It happens to all of us unfortunately.  Yep, sad but true. Would be nice if to have a vote of 1, 2 count, a voter would need to explain why s/he thinks it is so bad', '2011-09-05 09:48:12.000000', NULL, 0),
