(6530608, 969529, 8891, '<td valign="top">Did you know we shot this on the same night as well? I headed almost to the West end of the bridge. Perhaps we can meet up some day. Thanks for your comment and it is interesting how close we finished.</td>', 'Did you know we shot this on the same night as well? I headed almost to the West end of the bridge. Perhaps we can meet up some day. Thanks for your comment and it is interesting how close we finished.', '2011-09-06 20:26:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(6530665, 969447, 102534, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LydiaToo:</b></div><hr/><i> I thought it was a bit oversharpened, but really lovely.  Congrats on your ribbon! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks Lydia. I struggle like hell with sharpening and in general think my entries are not quite sharp enough after I upload them so I did a more aggressive sharpen on this one. Hopefully I can crack the sharpening code one day.</td>', 'Originally posted by LydiaToo: I thought it was a bit oversharpened, but really lovely.  Congrats on your ribbon!  Thanks Lydia. I struggle like hell with sharpening and in general think my entries are not quite sharp enough after I upload them so I did a more aggressive sharpen on this one. Hopefully I can crack the sharpening code one day.', '2011-09-06 21:36:39.000000', NULL, 0),
