(6544112, 969779, 90495, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by toddster45:</b></div><hr/><i> I feel it could have been abit more alive seems dull in away not enough light could have done with a longer exposure i feel still good attempt </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I don''t want to sound arrogant but maybe what you described in your comment was exactly what the photographer was going for. Check the exposure time, plenty of time to capture all highlights and even blow them out so when I dropped the tones down they still appeared relatively bright. <br/> <br/>Melethia was spot on, so was everyone else. ;-)</td>', 'Originally posted by toddster45: I feel it could have been abit more alive seems dull in away not enough light could have done with a longer exposure i feel still good attempt   I don''t want to sound arrogant but maybe what you described in your comment was exactly what the photographer was going for. Check the exposure time, plenty of time to capture all highlights and even blow them out so when I dropped the tones down they still appeared relatively bright.  Melethia was spot on, so was everyone else. ;-)', '2011-09-18 12:51:59.000000', NULL, 0),
